                <l xml:id="m-deea4ae3-48d7-4156-83ed-286fa3b6db8e" facs="#m-9bc0f705-a503-4b2a-a5e1-24c28a427e0e" label="text-like">oth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-7f05cc4a-e52e-4642-acc5-5d7729eccd8c" facs="#m-b97b5eca-075e-4eeb-96f4-32dad902cd37" label="ambiguous">1017</l><l xml:id="m-11adcb54-1407-4d15-981b-1428c05bc5a1" facs="#m-4b33e592-5b36-4900-bbe0-af4ba53e4991" label="lyrics-like">céptor est ánimae mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-54a425bb-190f-4df8-8593-352b00f65f96" facs="#m-654b8f45-4e54-40de-9dfc-d611721b0ff0" label="ambiguous">in-i¬</l><l xml:id="m-1031127a-17b8-4a75-88f5-74040c8a87a8" facs="#m-47b66e98-aede-4cc1-9262-18d5a685e411" label="lyrics-like">ae: avérte má¬ la</l><l xml:id="m-af57e6f4-b56b-46cc-8b93-77c1b2da2815" facs="#m-fd68de61-0770-4288-a87e-3f2368bf385d" label="lyrics-like">dispérde f¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e7284c1-5496-4f1a-afc9-ea0bfccd6722" facs="#m-838f3feb-9ec3-4d8c-a3c5-99f44e57f73a" label="lyrics-like">in ve-ri-tá-te tú¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-22acfcc6-7025-4f13-bfd2-b78233bb5b12" facs="#m-cf1b22c4-fc98-4492-874e-08f02d0a46b8" label="lyrics-like">mí-cis mé¬ is,</l><l xml:id="m-293690e8-fc70-4de5-b8cc-bcf033d8786d" facs="#m-d4f5e992-37ec-48ae-88d6-d39029e0ddc6" label="lyrics-like">us Dómi- ne. Ps. Dé-us</l><l xml:id="m-ad13fa9b-aaeb-4799-8de6-621fd0ec69e7" facs="#m-d7455136-4b00-4cc7-8e15-4be262b33287" label="lyrics-like">los, pro-téctor mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-1df47813-12aa-4609-9e99-19d6330ab1ef" facs="#m-454e9345-21cd-420b-b044-0425efc819da" label="lyrics-like">in nómine tú-o sálvum me fac: “ et in virtú-te tú-a jú¬</l><l xml:id="m-83ab1ca3-6207-4271-8307-6274bdccbe94" facs="#m-a4f01d32-119d-4169-9aba-b134a6eaebb9" label="lyrics-like">dica me. Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-cfb282d1-f01f-4c37-9d31-8780d0f27fdf" facs="#m-10bc3a73-4f03-4629-b839-ba523b4c4f68" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-5e696154-4bdd-4870-9e35-a7e62a0b1482" facs="#m-56ad89e5-fdb6-4e35-ab4f-ab5279c76791" label="lyrics-like">Ateant aures misericórdiae tuae  concédas, * fac eos quae tibi sunt</l><l xml:id="m-30f77755-c7eb-43ae-bf54-726e5f7383d7" facs="#m-726e18e1-152f-4b5e-a691-49c0735338d8" label="lyrics-like">L Dómine précibus supplicán-plácita postuláre. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0d641428-495b-4491-a44b-502efc8b3f24" facs="#m-29cc318b-955e-430f-80e3-345dd306c665" label="lyrics-like">tium: t et ut peténtibus desideráta</l><l xml:id="m-f76e1b15-c87c-4dff-ba2c-1b361dd22050" facs="#m-363ff2a3-e203-4393-bb9b-3e7fbe8f2732" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 8. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-991d0a0a-e304-45f3-8797-0259215cbfcb" facs="#m-a0bd2474-9cf7-4529-97d3-c0937ac7cb7c" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. I. Cor. ro. b.</l><l xml:id="m-45891b3c-c328-4bd3-b386-3c38634dd658" facs="#m-dba1daef-b208-453e-951c-67d2a1b79955" label="lyrics-like">Ratres: Non simus concupi-] dam eórum murmuravérunt, et per¬</l><l xml:id="m-a7064411-333e-459f-a52a-654e9ae9479f" facs="#m-c1d0ee62-82df-492f-85f7-6f4c1efd60bf" label="lyrics-like">scéntes malórum, sicut et illi</l><l xml:id="m-206ec2cc-91d1-4f10-9d58-6e72aab62b82" facs="#m-5a5ba505-d898-4f60-89e5-f222f489a5e3" label="lyrics-like">iérunt ab exterminatóre. Haec au¬</l><l xml:id="m-4cc74f23-e387-4ce9-b7d1-2ed8268e05af" facs="#m-15680a18-d8bc-4239-ad72-3fd38a0a893a" label="lyrics-like">tem ómnia in figúra contingébant</l><l xml:id="m-68c046ca-722c-4cbf-99d4-1cc10039c705" facs="#m-1f24242f-1d2d-4469-a6cb-78c44276c76d" label="lyrics-like">concupiérunt. Neque idolólatrae ef¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d08d572-ed95-4491-aa9b-ee5c22013be1" facs="#m-14c1e478-9ed7-4bce-8f71-49db029bf14b" label="ambiguous">illis : scripta sunt autem ad corre¬</l><l xml:id="m-493a1def-2b68-4f5a-b363-16c01486ffb0" facs="#m-765b7621-46cb-4c9b-8c37-347abf4e4e27" label="lyrics-like">ficiámini, sicut quidam ex ipsis:</l><l xml:id="m-a8f2dd05-61d8-41ea-9ad2-6b3c756b7707" facs="#m-7e12ce0d-8142-4e18-872a-8039ec223aaa" label="lyrics-like">ptiónem nostram, in quos fines sae¬</l><l xml:id="m-713dae55-0967-41cf-be00-31fea421398b" facs="#m-9af337bd-fa02-48bb-a3f2-3f5c83ec6495" label="lyrics-like">quemádmodum scriptum est: Sedit</l><l xml:id="m-29ba8500-90d7-4dec-b89b-1afdd70a2e73" facs="#m-0b2a7c5a-8573-4faf-acc5-bc7efba8150e" label="lyrics-like">pópulus manducáre et bibere, et</l><l xml:id="m-5c2621ec-948f-49cc-ab91-f556fd463476" facs="#m-851d7930-8d09-4c68-b162-16a607a42975" label="lyrics-like">culórum devenérunt. Itaque qui se</l><l xml:id="m-229610f4-0796-4318-84e7-9676840ccc26" facs="#m-47920d11-8ac4-4cfe-8e03-0b57b0b0ce7f" label="lyrics-like">exístimat stare, videat ne cadat.</l><l xml:id="m-c27a3f46-aad1-4266-9926-bfc19561b8c0" facs="#m-4a7789ea-7c05-4b40-821a-1be532139165" label="lyrics-like">surrexérunt lúdere. Neque fornicé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c44cdaad-84af-4c03-a8b2-81d4e630c854" facs="#m-25a21792-9f9a-4a37-abc9-91d3dcd076d3" label="lyrics-like">mur, sicut quidam ex ipsis fornicáti</l><l xml:id="m-bb4dbfc3-3813-4d6f-a2a7-1f664560ab1a" facs="#m-4fa28a87-01d9-4a06-a17f-47dd6ec0f39f" label="lyrics-like">Tentátio vos non apprehéndat, nisi</l><l xml:id="m-49e8645b-3772-4f33-a179-e52cd4878655" facs="#m-66a3fc65-41dc-4e08-8841-738e4eecce76" label="lyrics-like">humána: fidélis autem Deus est,</l><l xml:id="m-5bcbbef5-eaa7-4e7d-830b-ac9f8c9d3866" facs="#m-194bcae3-d5ac-4021-8f1b-00d70ca259a5" label="lyrics-like">sunt, et cecidérunt una die viginti</l><l xml:id="m-5f737d22-e8b8-493a-9323-b362a7989895" facs="#m-11c3b7e7-383c-4b11-89a0-d500ab3417f6" label="lyrics-like">tria millia. Neque tentémus Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-20daf322-f9a9-4516-80c6-8d5e996e31ec" facs="#m-5ab29379-2c1f-4e45-842f-ff84884a2ce3" label="lyrics-like">qui non patiétur vos tentári supra</l><l xml:id="m-52cfbe55-131e-4d58-b17f-dc81c34679a6" facs="#m-bd34b397-790e-4f3d-b274-928092073636" label="lyrics-like">id quod potéstis, sed fáciet étiam</l><l xml:id="m-35c2fdc6-67d4-477e-9355-96ed0b6b3a9c" facs="#m-172d6930-1f28-4ec9-aa9e-f438021acc21" label="lyrics-like">stum, sicut quidam eórum tentavé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b712c40d-2b85-4b2b-8f07-2e85efcf21b6" facs="#m-00416db5-5e66-48e9-a87b-de8648195c73" label="lyrics-like">runt, et a serpéntibus periérunt. ]cum tentatióne provéntum, ut pos¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2093473-44a5-47e1-b32f-e468853bd58b" facs="#m-9baf6a96-9b03-459d-87a6-fd6bba7a1fd6" label="lyrics-like">Neque murmuravéritis, sicut qui- sitis sustinére.</l><l xml:id="m-0e1f6f2c-0140-4acd-87db-d312d9077291" facs="#m-ac42ea32-96c4-4536-b6ea-7caa99b34f5a" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-e7bee0b6-435c-409e-9e11-53c4af1bf336" facs="#m-1e4c6ace-3d38-4c9d-ab38-f2fefa4dd1c5" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-fcb959d5-acea-4efe-a852-863893417916" facs="#m-496173db-62ea-4aa4-91ff-fda4da562326" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-1614a4d1-e462-4dbe-bf54-eed8be29774a" facs="#m-236debb5-c8a5-4f6f-849e-e96a7b34bbbe" label="lyrics-like">Omine“ Dó-mi-nus nóster,</l><l xml:id="m-7fe8eba9-1039-4cf3-923c-e41ebeb46f44" facs="#m-6b1ab750-b7cb-4ca4-887a-e9e34ee8c1d5" label="ambiguous">quam ad¬</l></lg>
